  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.8.0: required column missing from header throws RequiredColumnMissingException; duplicate header throws DuplicateColumnNameException; empty header name no longer throws ArgumentNullException; no false missing-required error on short lines; spaces after a closing quote are dropped; leading/trailing spaces are quoted on write; re-reading a StreamReader discards stale buffer and skips the BOM. 1.7.0: UseThousandsSeparator=false no longer mutates CultureInfo.CurrentCulture; fixed IndexOutOfRangeException with IgnoreUnknownColumns + EnforceCsvColumnAttribute; AggregatedException rethrown with its original stack trace; targets netstandard2.0, net8.0 and net48 (net6.0 dropped); symbol package and Source Link.",
